      "text": {
        "jp": "そ、そんなことわかってる！\r\n当然のことだ！",
        "official_en": "And you take care not to cut yourself on that sharp wit, Rain!\r\nLet’s show them what we’re made of!",
        "real_en": "I-I know that! Of course I do!"
